.TH SMFOLD 1
.SH NAME
smfold \- fold a sheet metal part
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smfold
[
.B \-M
] [
.B \-D
.IR name = expr
] ...
.I part.sm
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Smfold
reads the source of a sheet metal part,
.IR sm (5),
and writes the folded part, its flat blank with the map of each face
and the feature of each edge and hole, as a stream,
.IR stream (5),
on the standard output.
.TP
.BI \-D " name" = expr
Set the parameter
.I name
to
.IR expr ,
overriding every definition of it.
.TP
.B \-M
Instead, print the names of the included parameters used by the part.
.SH SEE ALSO
plicad(7), sm(5), stream(5), smflat(1), tostep(1), measure(1),
smview(1)
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
FILE:LINE: and the fault, for a statement that cannot be built.
